                    <h4 class="font-black text-base text-slate-800" id="mCutiTitle">Rincian Cuti Guru Disetujui</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500" id="mCutiSubtitle">Catatan riwayat cuti resmi disahkan Kurikulum</p>
